                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Essentially a collection of puzzles with emphasis on hidden object challenges; Dracula, Love Kills becomes more captivating the more you play it.  Aside from some cliche voice work and dialog, the game can catch and keep you for a long time and provide enduring amusement.  For a gothic horror twist on entertaining brainteasers, this game is quite satisfactory.  Rated 7 out of 10.",
